  "correct": "3",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven: 24 ÷ 3 – 4 × 2 + 6 × 5 +12 = 50\n\nAccording to the question, after interchanging the numbers:\n\nOption 1) 5 and 4\n\n24 ÷ 3 – 4 × 2 + 6 × 5 +12 = 50 ⇒ 24 ÷ 3 – 5 × 2 + 6 × 4 +12 = 50\n\n⇒ __**24 ÷ 3**__ – 5 × 2 + 6 × 4 +12 = 50\n\n⇒ 8 – __**5 × 2**__ + __**6 × 4**__ +12 = 50\n\n⇒ __**8 + 24 +12**__ – 10 = 50\n\n⇒ __44____** – 10**__ = 50\n\n⇒ 34 ≠ 50 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 2) 4 and 3\n\n24 ÷ 3 – 4 × 2 + 6 × 5 +12 = 50 ⇒ 24 ÷ 4 – 3 × 2 + 6 × 5 +12 = 50\n\n⇒ __**24 ÷ 4**__ – 3 × 2 + 6 × 5 +12 = 50\n\n⇒ 6 – __**3 × 2**__ + __**6 × 5**__ +12 = 50\n\n⇒ __**6 + 30 +12**__ – 6 = 50\n\n⇒ __48____** – 6**__ = 50\n\n⇒ 42 ≠ 50 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 3) 24 and 12\n\n24 ÷ 3 – 4 × 2 + 6 × 5 +12 = 50 ⇒ 12 ÷ 3 – 4 × 2 + 6 × 5 +24 = 50\n\n⇒ __**12 ÷ 3**__ – 4 × 2 + 6 × 5 +24 = 50\n\n⇒ 4 – __**4 × 2**__ + __**6 × 5**__ +24 = 50\n\n⇒ __4 + 30 +24__ – 8 = 50\n\n⇒ __58____ – 8__ = 50\n\n**⇒ 50 = 50 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nOption 4) 3 and 2\n\n24 ÷ 3 – 4 × 2 + 6 × 5 +12 = 50 ⇒ 24 ÷ 2 – 4 × 3 + 6 × 5 +12 = 50\n\n⇒ __**24 ÷ 2**__ – 4 × 3 + 6 × 5 +12 = 50\n\n⇒ 12 – __**4 × 3**__ + __**6 × 5**__ +12 = 50\n\n⇒ __12 + 30 +12__ – 12 = 50\n\n⇒ __54____ – 12__ = 50\n\n⇒ 42 ≠ 50 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option 3\" is the correct answer.",
